draft: DRAFT-libxdp-1.6.3-ohos-seccomp-unshare-sigsys
status: pending-editor-review
id: DRAFT-libxdp-1.6.3-ohos-seccomp-unshare-sigsys
title: OHOS seccomp 以 SIGSYS 杀死 unshare(CLONE_NEWNET|CLONE_NEWNS)，上游隔离测试套件第一步即 core dump
trigger_tool: unshare|make|sudo|bash
phase: testing
error_signature: invalid system call (core dumped)|Executing tests in separate net- and mount namespaces.*invalid system call
severity: 2
category: platform, seccomp, testing
match_keywords: unshare, unshare -n -m, CLONE_NEWNET, CLONE_NEWNS, invalid system call, core dumped, SIGSYS, seccomp, net namespace, mount namespace, test_runner.sh, DID_UNSHARE
root_cause: 上游测试 runner 常用 exec unshare -n -m 建私有 net/mount namespace 以隔离地建 veth、挂 bpffs；OHOS 的 seccomp 策略不放行 unshare/CLONE_NEWNET/CLONE_NEWNS，进程在第一步即被 SIGSYS 杀死并 core dump，用例一条也不执行。
affected_scope: 所有依赖 unshare -n/-m（或 CLONE_NEWNET/CLONE_NEWNS）在上游套件里做隔离的构建/测试脚本；在 OHOS 真机上均第一步失败
verification_cmd: sudo env PATH=... /data/service/hnp/bin/bash ./test_runner.sh ./test-libxdp.sh 2>&1 | grep -E "Executing tests in separate net-|invalid system call"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: bypass-unshare-with-did-unshare
rec_description: 若只要拿到测试结果，可置 DID_UNSHARE=1 让 runner 跳过 unshare 重执行、落宿主 netns 继续；此时 veth/bpffs 仍受 SELinux/内核限制（见同批另一条）。判定"上游不可跑"须以本 syscall 拦截为硬证据，而非写"未执行"。
rec_command: DID_UNSHARE=1 sudo env PATH=$SHIMS:/data/service/hnp/bin:/usr/bin:/vendor/bin:/system/bin bash ./test_runner.sh ./test-libxdp.sh
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: test-harness
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: declare-whitelist-exemption
fallback_description: 若上游套件确依赖 unshare 隔离而 OHOS 不放行，应在 notes/PR 逐条如实申报为环境阻塞，并走主办方 ci/config/no_official_test.txt 的正式豁免通道；不要为点亮 L1c 在 build() 里硬塞 make test（CI worker 同为 OHOS，会变红）。
fallback_command: echo libxdp >> ci/config/no_official_test.txt  # 需附不可兼容证据
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: docs
similar_to:
principles:
doc_file: DRAFT-libxdp-1.6.3-ohos-seccomp-unshare-sigsys.md
source_event: libxdp 1.6.3 鸿蒙电脑真机：上游 test_runner.sh 忠实模式 unshare -n -m 报 zsh: invalid system call (core dumped)
authors: staralsnow
